    "message": "Refuse moving a staffed station away from its staff\n\nWater and meal stations are served only by staff with the matching\nskill who work in the station's own zone, and nothing moves staff with\na transferred station. Moving the water station into the sleeping\narea therefore stopped water service for the rest of the Run while the\nintervention looked applied (#83).\n\nUntil a rule for moving or dispatching staff is agreed, refuse such a\ntransfer before approval with a staff_unavailable reason. A transfer\nto a zone where those staff work, and any transfer of an unstaffed\nfacility such as a toilet, still applies.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
